 Assisting in targeting and evaluating new investment opportunities;
 Assess potential investments through financial modeling and company/industry research;
 Working with operating teams to be a key contributor in the planning and completion of due diligence;
 Prepare investment committee materials and other transaction documents;
 Monitor and assist in the management of existing portfolio companies;
 Contribute to a flexible, dynamic, and team-oriented working culture that fosters personal development and a positive attitude;
 Special projects as required.
